---
// Interactive Patroni HA & Failover Explorer Component - Step-by-Step Incident Pipeline
---

<div class="patroni-explorer not-prose my-8 border border-[var(--border)] bg-[var(--bg-subtle)]/50 rounded-[2px] overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
  <!-- Component Header -->
  <div class="px-4 py-3 bg-[var(--bg)] border-b border-[var(--border)] flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-2">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
      <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[var(--status-green)] animate-pulse" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-[var(--text)]">
        Patroni Adım Adım Küme Yönetimi & Failover Boru Hattı
      </span>
    </div>
    <span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-[var(--text-dim)]">
      PostgreSQL 16 · Patroni 3.3.0 · etcd v3.5 · Adım Adım Akış
    </span>
  </div>

  <!-- Interactive Scenario Selector -->
  <div class="p-3 bg-[var(--bg-subtle)]/70 border-b border-[var(--border)]">
    <div class="text-[11px] font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-[var(--text-dim)] mb-2 font-semibold">
      Senaryo Seçimi:
    </div>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5" role="tablist" aria-label="Patroni Senaryoları">
      <button
        type="button"
        class="patroni-scenario-btn px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-[2px] text-xs font-mono transition-all cursor-pointer bg-[var(--text)] text-[var(--bg)] font-medium border border-[var(--text)] is-active"
        data-scenario="sync"
        role="tab"
        aria-selected="true"
      >
        01 · Sağlıklı Küme & Senkron Akış
      </button>
      <button
        type="button"
        class="patroni-scenario-btn px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-[2px] text-xs font-mono transition-all cursor-pointer bg-[var(--bg)] text-[var(--text-muted)] hover:text-[var(--text)] border border-[var(--border)] hover:border-[var(--border-strong)]"
        data-scenario="switchover"
        role="tab"
        aria-selected="false"
      >
        02 · Planlı Bakım & Switchover
      </button>
      <button
        type="button"
        class="patroni-scenario-btn px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-[2px] text-xs font-mono transition-all cursor-pointer bg-[var(--bg)] text-[var(--text-muted)] hover:text-[var(--text)] border border-[var(--border)] hover:border-[var(--border-strong)]"
        data-scenario="failover"
        role="tab"
        aria-selected="false"
      >
        03 · Primary Çökmesi & Failover
      </button>
      <button
        type="button"
        class="patroni-scenario-btn px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-[2px] text-xs font-mono transition-all cursor-pointer bg-[var(--bg)] text-[var(--text-muted)] hover:text-[var(--text)] border border-[var(--border)] hover:border-[var(--border-strong)]"
        data-scenario="splitbrain"
        role="tab"
        aria-selected="false"
      >
        04 · Ağ İzolasyonu & Fencing
      </button>
      <button
        type="button"
        class="patroni-scenario-btn px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-[2px] text-xs font-mono transition-all cursor-pointer bg-[var(--bg)] text-[var(--text-muted)] hover:text-[var(--text)] border border-[var(--border)] hover:border-[var(--border-strong)]"
        data-scenario="rewind"
        role="tab"
        aria-selected="false"
      >
        05 · pg_rewind ile Yeniden Katılma
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Step-by-Step Incident & Consensus Pipeline -->
  <div class="p-4 space-y-4">
    <!-- Summary Description of Scenario -->
    <div class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-sans text-[var(--text-muted)] bg-[var(--bg)] p-3 border border-[var(--border)] rounded-[2px]" id="patroni-scenario-description">
      pg-node-1 lider konumunda, pg-node-2 senkron replika olarak işlem taahhütlerini (commit) doğrular, pg-node-3 asenkron olarak takip eder.
    </div>

    <!-- Stepper Pipeline: Adım Adım Parçalar -->
    <div class="space-y-4">
      <!-- ADIM 1: Küme Yönetim Komutu (patronictl) -->
      <div class="border border-[var(--border)] rounded-[2px] bg-[var(--bg)] overflow-hidden shadow-xs">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[var(--border)] bg-[var(--bg-subtle)]/70 px-3 py-2">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-mono font-bold rounded-[2px] bg-[var(--text)] text-[var(--bg)]">ADIM 1</span>
            <span class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold text-[var(--text)]">Küme Durumu & Yönetim Komutu (patronictl CLI)</span>
          </div>
          <button
            type="button"
            class="patroni-copy-step-btn px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-mono rounded-[2px] border border-[var(--border)] bg-[var(--bg)] text-[var(--text-dim)] hover:text-[var(--text)] transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-1 cursor-pointer"
            data-target="patroni-code-cli"
          >
            Kopyala
          </button>
        </div>
        <div class="p-3.5 font-mono text-xs overflow-x-auto bg-[#0D1117] text-[#E6EDF3]">
          <pre><code id="patroni-code-cli">{`+ Cluster: postgres-ha (7349182391029381023) +---------+
| Member    | Host          | Role    | State   | TL | Lag in MB |
+-----------+---------------+---------+---------+----+-----------+
| pg-node-1 | 192.168.10.11 | Primary | running |  1 |           |
| pg-node-2 | 192.168.10.12 | Sync    | running |  1 |         0 |
| pg-node-3 | 192.168.10.13 | Replica | running |  1 |         0 |
+-----------+---------------+---------+---------+----+-----------+`}</code></pre>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Connector Note 1 -->
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px] font-mono text-[var(--accent)] px-2">
        <span class="text-base leading-none">↓</span>
        <span id="patroni-step-note-1">Patroni, küme genelindeki konsensüs durumunu etcd üzerindeki anahtarlarla senkronize tutar.</span>
      </div>

      <!-- ADIM 2: Dağıtık Konsensüs Durumu (etcd / DCS) -->
      <div class="border border-[var(--border)] rounded-[2px] bg-[var(--bg)] overflow-hidden shadow-xs">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[var(--border)] bg-[var(--bg-subtle)]/70 px-3 py-2">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-mono font-bold rounded-[2px] bg-[var(--accent)] text-white">ADIM 2</span>
            <span class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold text-[var(--text)]">Dağıtık Konsensüs & Lider Anahtarı Durumu (etcd / DCS)</span>
          </div>
          <button
            type="button"
            class="patroni-copy-step-btn px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-mono rounded-[2px] border border-[var(--border)] bg-[var(--bg)] text-[var(--text-dim)] hover:text-[var(--text)] transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-1 cursor-pointer"
            data-target="patroni-code-dcs"
          >
            Kopyala
          </button>
        </div>
        <div class="p-3.5 font-mono text-xs overflow-x-auto bg-[#0D1117] text-[#E6EDF3]">
          <pre><code id="patroni-code-dcs">{`// etcdctl get --prefix /service/postgres-ha/
/service/postgres-ha/leader:
{"version": "3.3.0", "role": "primary", "state": "running", "leader": "pg-node-1"}

/service/postgres-ha/sync:
{"leader": "pg-node-1", "sync_standby": "pg-node-2"}

/service/postgres-ha/members/pg-node-1:
{"conn_url": "postgres://192.168.10.11:5432/postgres", "api_url": "http://192.168.10.11:8008/patroni", "state": "running", "role": "primary", "xlog_location": 184549384}`}</code></pre>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Connector Note 2 -->
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px] font-mono text-[var(--status-green)] px-2">
        <span class="text-base leading-none">↓</span>
        <span id="patroni-step-note-2">HAProxy yük dengeleyicisi port 8008 REST API sağlık kontrolüyle trafiği anında aktif lidere yönlendirir.</span>
      </div>

      <!-- ADIM 3: Yönlendirme ve Sağlık Testi (HAProxy & Timeline ID) -->
      <div class="border border-[var(--border)] rounded-[2px] bg-[var(--bg)] overflow-hidden shadow-xs">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[var(--border)] bg-[var(--bg-subtle)]/70 px-3 py-2">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-mono font-bold rounded-[2px] bg-[var(--status-green)] text-white">ADIM 3</span>
            <span class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold text-[var(--text)]">Yönlendirme & Sağlık Testi (HAProxy Port 5000 & Timeline ID)</span>
          </div>
          <button
            type="button"
            class="patroni-copy-step-btn px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-mono rounded-[2px] border border-[var(--border)] bg-[var(--bg)] text-[var(--text-dim)] hover:text-[var(--text)] transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-1 cursor-pointer"
            data-target="patroni-code-haproxy"
          >
            Kopyala
          </button>
        </div>
        <div class="p-3.5 font-mono text-xs overflow-x-auto bg-[#0D1117] text-[#E6EDF3]">
          <pre><code id="patroni-code-haproxy">{`# HAProxy Sağlık Kontrolleri (Port 5000 Write Havuzu):
$ curl -s -i http://192.168.10.11:8008/primary
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
Content-Type: application/json
{"state": "running", "postmaster_start_time": "2026-11-10 14:00:01 UTC", "role": "primary", "server_version": 160002}

$ curl -s -i http://192.168.10.12:8008/primary
HTTP/1.1 503 Service Unavailable

# pg_controldata /var/lib/postgresql/data (pg-node-1):
Database cluster state:               in production
Latest checkpoint's TimeLineID:        1
Latest checkpoint's REDO WAL file:     00000001000000000000000B`}</code></pre>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- ADIM 4: Web Dashboard & Canlı Durum -->
      <div class="border border-[var(--border)] rounded-[2px] bg-[var(--bg)] overflow-hidden shadow-xs">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[var(--border)] bg-[var(--bg-subtle)]/70 px-3 py-2">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-mono font-bold rounded-[2px] bg-[var(--text-dim)] text-white">ADIM 4</span>
            <span class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold text-[var(--text)]">Web Yönetim Paneli (Patroni-UI & Düğüm Matrisi)</span>
          </div>
          <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-[var(--status-green)] font-semibold flex items-center gap-1">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[var(--status-green)]"></span>
            Canlı Arayüz
          </span>
        </div>

        <div class="p-3 bg-[var(--bg)] space-y-3">
          <!-- Top cluster bar -->
          <div class="p-2.5 bg-[var(--bg-subtle)] border border-[var(--border)] rounded-[2px] flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-2">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold text-[var(--text)]">postgres-ha.cluster</span>
              <span class="text-[10px] font-mono px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-[var(--status-green)]/15 text-[var(--status-green)] rounded-[2px] font-medium" id="patroni-ui-quorum-badge">Quorum: 2/3 (Sağlıklı)</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <button
                type="button"
                id="patroni-action-switchover"
                class="px-2 py-1 text-[11px] font-mono font-medium rounded-[2px] bg-[var(--accent)] text-white hover:bg-[var(--accent-hover)] transition-colors cursor-pointer"
              >
                ⚡ Switchover Yap
              </button>
              <button
                type="button"
                id="patroni-action-pause"
                class="px-2 py-1 text-[11px] font-mono font-medium rounded-[2px] border border-[var(--border)] bg-[var(--bg)] text-[var(--text-muted)] hover:text-[var(--text)] transition-colors cursor-pointer"
              >
                ⏸ Bakım Modu
              </button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- 3-Node Matrix -->
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-2.5 font-mono text-xs">
            <div class="p-2.5 rounded-[2px] border border-[var(--border)] bg-[var(--bg-subtle)]/70 space-y-1">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[var(--border)] pb-1">
                <span class="font-semibold text-[var(--text)]">pg-node-1</span>
                <span id="ui-card-role-node1" class="px-1.5 py-0.2 text-[10px] rounded-[2px] bg-[var(--status-green)]/15 text-[var(--status-green)] font-medium">PRIMARY</span>
              </div>
              <div class="text-[11px] text-[var(--text-muted)] space-y-0.5">
                <div class="flex justify-between"><span>Sağlık:</span> <span id="ui-card-health-node1" class="text-[var(--status-green)] font-semibold">200 OK</span></div>
                <div class="flex justify-between"><span>Timeline:</span> <span id="ui-card-tl-node1" class="text-[var(--text)] font-semibold">TL 1</span></div>
                <div class="flex justify-between"><span>Lag:</span> <span id="ui-card-lag-node1" class="text-[var(--text)]">0 MB</span></div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="p-2.5 rounded-[2px] border border-[var(--border)] bg-[var(--bg-subtle)]/70 space-y-1">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[var(--border)] pb-1">
                <span class="font-semibold text-[var(--text)]">pg-node-2</span>
                <span id="ui-card-role-node2" class="px-1.5 py-0.2 text-[10px] rounded-[2px] bg-[var(--accent-subtle)] text-[var(--accent)] font-medium">SYNC STANDBY</span>
              </div>
              <div class="text-[11px] text-[var(--text-muted)] space-y-0.5">
                <div class="flex justify-between"><span>Sağlık:</span> <span id="ui-card-health-node2" class="text-[var(--status-green)] font-semibold">200 OK (replica)</span></div>
                <div class="flex justify-between"><span>Timeline:</span> <span id="ui-card-tl-node2" class="text-[var(--text)] font-semibold">TL 1</span></div>
                <div class="flex justify-between"><span>Lag:</span> <span id="ui-card-lag-node2" class="text-[var(--status-green)] font-semibold">0 ms</span></div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="p-2.5 rounded-[2px] border border-[var(--border)] bg-[var(--bg-subtle)]/70 space-y-1">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[var(--border)] pb-1">
                <span class="font-semibold text-[var(--text)]">pg-node-3</span>
                <span id="ui-card-role-node3" class="px-1.5 py-0.2 text-[10px] rounded-[2px] bg-[var(--bg)] text-[var(--text-muted)] border border-[var(--border)] font-medium">ASYNC STANDBY</span>
              </div>
              <div class="text-[11px] text-[var(--text-muted)] space-y-0.5">
                <div class="flex justify-between"><span>Sağlık:</span> <span id="ui-card-health-node3" class="text-[var(--status-green)] font-semibold">200 OK (replica)</span></div>
                <div class="flex justify-between"><span>Timeline:</span> <span id="ui-card-tl-node3" class="text-[var(--text)] font-semibold">TL 1</span></div>
                <div class="flex justify-between"><span>Lag:</span> <span id="ui-card-lag-node3" class="text-[var(--text)]">0 byte</span></div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Architectural Insights Callout -->
    <div class="p-3 bg-[var(--bg-subtle)] border border-[var(--border)] rounded-[2px] flex items-start gap-2.5 text-xs font-mono">
      <span class="text-[var(--accent)] font-bold">⚡ Mimari Çıkarım:</span>
      <span class="text-[var(--text-muted)] font-sans" id="patroni-architecture-note">
        Senkron replikasyon modunda (synchronous_mode: true), pg-node-1 yerel diske yazdığı WAL bloğunu pg-node-2'ye flush ettirmeden istemciye COMMIT yanıtı dönmez. Bu sayede donanım arızalarında RPO (Recovery Point Objective) tam olarak 0'dır.
      </span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<script is:inline>
  (function() {
    const patroniScenarios = {
      sync: {
        desc: "pg-node-1 lider konumunda, pg-node-2 senkron replika olarak işlem taahhütlerini (commit) doğrular, pg-node-3 asenkron olarak takip eder.",
        stepNote1: "Patroni her 10 saniyede bir etcd üzerindeki /leader anahtarını yeniler.",
        stepNote2: "HAProxy 8008 /primary kontrolüyle tüm yazma trafiğini pg-node-1'e yönlendirir.",
        uiNode1: { role: "PRIMARY", roleClass: "bg-[var(--status-green)]/15 text-[var(--status-green)]", health: "200 OK", tl: "TL 1", lag: "0 MB" },
        uiNode2: { role: "SYNC STANDBY", roleClass: "bg-[var(--accent-subtle)] text-[var(--accent)]", health: "200 OK (replica)", tl: "TL 1", lag: "0 ms" },
        uiNode3: { role: "ASYNC STANDBY", roleClass: "bg-[var(--bg)] text-[var(--text-muted)] border border-[var(--border)]", health: "200 OK (replica)", tl: "TL 1", lag: "0 byte" },
        quorum: "Quorum: 2/3 (Sağlıklı)",
        cli: `+ Cluster: postgres-ha (7349182391029381023) +---------+
| Member    | Host          | Role    | State   | TL | Lag in MB |
+-----------+---------------+---------+---------+----+-----------+
| pg-node-1 | 192.168.10.11 | Primary | running |  1 |           |
| pg-node-2 | 192.168.10.12 | Sync    | running |  1 |         0 |
| pg-node-3 | 192.168.10.13 | Replica | running |  1 |         0 |
+-----------+---------------+---------+---------+----+-----------+`,
        dcs: `// etcdctl get --prefix /service/postgres-ha/
/service/postgres-ha/leader:
{"version": "3.3.0", "role": "primary", "state": "running", "leader": "pg-node-1"}

/service/postgres-ha/sync:
{"leader": "pg-node-1", "sync_standby": "pg-node-2"}

/service/postgres-ha/members/pg-node-1:
{"conn_url": "postgres://192.168.10.11:5432/postgres", "api_url": "http://192.168.10.11:8008/patroni", "state": "running", "role": "primary", "xlog_location": 184549384}`,
        haproxy: `# HAProxy Sağlık Kontrolleri (Port 5000 Write Havuzu):
$ curl -s -i http://192.168.10.11:8008/primary
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
Content-Type: application/json
{"state": "running", "postmaster_start_time": "2026-11-10 14:00:01 UTC", "role": "primary", "server_version": 160002}

$ curl -s -i http://192.168.10.12:8008/primary
HTTP/1.1 503 Service Unavailable

# pg_controldata /var/lib/postgresql/data (pg-node-1):
Database cluster state:               in production
Latest checkpoint's TimeLineID:        1
Latest checkpoint's REDO WAL file:     00000001000000000000000B`,
        note: "Senkron replikasyon modunda (synchronous_mode: true), pg-node-1 yerel diske yazdığı WAL bloğunu pg-node-2'ye flush ettirmeden istemciye COMMIT yanıtı dönmez. Bu sayede donanım arızalarında RPO (Recovery Point Objective) tam olarak 0'dır."
      },
      switchover: {
        desc: "Yama veya donanım yükseltmesi amacıyla liderlik kontrollü olarak pg-node-1'den pg-node-2'ye devredilir. Sıfır veri kaybı, <2 sn kesinti.",
        stepNote1: "Liderlik anahtarı etcd üzerinde pg-node-1'den pg-node-2'ye devredildi.",
        stepNote2: "pg-node-2 promote edildi; Timeline 1 -> 2 yükseldi ve HAProxy yazma rotasını buraya bağladı.",
        uiNode1: { role: "DEMOTED REPLICA", roleClass: "bg-[var(--bg)] text-[var(--text-muted)] border border-[var(--border)]", health: "200 OK (replica)", tl: "TL 2", lag: "0 MB" },
        uiNode2: { role: "PRIMARY (PROMOTED)", roleClass: "bg-[var(--status-green)]/15 text-[var(--status-green)]", health: "200 OK", tl: "TL 2", lag: "0 MB" },
        uiNode3: { role: "SYNC STANDBY", roleClass: "bg-[var(--accent-subtle)] text-[var(--accent)]", health: "200 OK (replica)", tl: "TL 2", lag: "0 ms" },
        quorum: "Quorum: 3/3 (Geçiş Tamamlandı)",
        cli: `$ patronictl -c /etc/patroni/patroni.yml switchover --master pg-node-1 --candidate pg-node-2 --scheduled now
Current cluster topology
+-----------+---------------+---------+---------+----+-----------+
| Member    | Host          | Role    | State   | TL | Lag in MB |
+-----------+---------------+---------+---------+----+-----------+
| pg-node-1 | 192.168.10.11 | Primary | running |  1 |           |
| pg-node-2 | 192.168.10.12 | Sync    | running |  1 |         0 |
| pg-node-3 | 192.168.10.13 | Replica | running |  1 |         0 |
+-----------+---------------+---------+---------+----+-----------+
Are you sure you want to switch over to pg-node-2? [y/N]: y
2026-11-10 14:32:00.120 Successfully switched over to leader pg-node-2

+ Cluster: postgres-ha (7349182391029381023) +---------+
| Member    | Host          | Role    | State   | TL | Lag in MB |
+-----------+---------------+---------+---------+----+-----------+
| pg-node-1 | 192.168.10.11 | Replica | running |  2 |         0 |
| pg-node-2 | 192.168.10.12 | Primary | running |  2 |           |
| pg-node-3 | 192.168.10.13 | Sync    | running |  2 |         0 |
+-----------+---------------+---------+---------+----+-----------+`,
        dcs: `// Switchover sonrası etcd anahtarları anında güncellenir:
/service/postgres-ha/leader:
{"version": "3.3.0", "role": "primary", "state": "running", "leader": "pg-node-2"}

/service/postgres-ha/sync:
{"leader": "pg-node-2", "sync_standby": "pg-node-3"}`,
        haproxy: `# pg-node-2 artık Primary olarak 200 OK döner:
$ curl -s -i http://192.168.10.12:8008/primary
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
{"role": "primary", "server_version": 160002}

# pg_controldata (pg-node-2):
Database cluster state:               in production
Latest checkpoint's TimeLineID:        2  # <-- Timeline 1'den 2'ye geçti!`,
        note: "Switchover sırasında Patroni eski primary'ye checkpoint aldırıp WAL akışını durdurur. İki düğümün LSN'leri birebir eşitlendikten sonra promote gerçekleşir; böylece pg_rewind çalıştırmaya gerek kalmadan eski primary replika olarak yaşamına devam eder."
      },
      failover: {
        desc: "pg-node-1 fiziksel donanımı aniden kilitlendi (Kernel panic / elektrik kesintisi). DCS lease süresi doldu ve en güncel standby otomatik olarak primary ilan edildi.",
        stepNote1: "etcd leader lease TTL (30s) süresi doldu; kilit düşüp pg-node-2 tarafından devralındı.",
